# Trial Of The Scholar (Q214), last part, played by a level 36 Human Wizard at cond 23 who holds all but the last
# of each of Casian's trophies (every script roll pinned to 1): Edroc, Raut and Triff pass on the letter,
# the scripture and the liquor for the ring; Valkon's request and Maria's crystal give the second scripture
# and the Grandis, holding Triff's ring, drops the third; Casian's list is filled by Medusa, the ghoul, the
# fettered soul and the gargoyle; Cronos takes the scriptures for his symbol and Mirien takes the sigil and
# the symbol for the Mark of Scholar; then relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
